/**
 * Replaces Starlight's light/dark picker with nothing.
 *
 * The site is dark only (see `ThemeProvider.astro` and `src/styles/custom.css`),
 * so a control offering a choice that cannot be honoured is worse than no
 * control. Removed as an override rather than hidden with CSS: hiding it would
 * leave the <select>, its custom element and its localStorage writes in the
 * page, reachable by keyboard and by assistive technology, still promising a
 * light theme that will never arrive.
 */
